      "widgets_values": [
        "IMAGE TO 3D ASSET (LOCAL HUNYUAN3D 2.1)\n\nThis workflow runs locally after the Hunyuan model is downloaded. It generates geometry from one image, converts it to a mesh, previews it, and saves a GLB.\n\nRTX 3060 12 GB guidance: keep resolution at 3072, batch size 1, and octree resolution 256. If CUDA runs out of memory, lower Empty Latent resolution to 2048 and VAEDecode octree resolution to 192. Generation may be slow.\n\nThe local model provides shape/geometry. It does not automatically produce the same textured result as Tripo. Use the cloud Tripo workflow when you need a ready-made textured asset.\n\nModel file: models/checkpoints/hunyuan_3d_v2.1.safetensors (about 7 GB)."
      ]
